---
import BaseLayout from '@layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Footer from '@components/global/Footer.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Privacy and cookies | Unicornio Azul"
  description="Privacy and cookie policy for Unicornio Azul. How we process your personal data and which cookies we use under the GDPR."
  showHeader={true}
>

<section class="relative" style="background:#FFFFFF;">
  <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-6 md:px-10 pt-28 md:pt-36 pb-20 md:pb-28">

    <span class="text-[11px] tracking-[0.35em] uppercase font-semibold opacity-35" style="color:#6B7280;font-family:'Satoshi',sans-serif;">Legal</span>
    <h1 class="mt-4 text-4xl md:text-5xl lg:text-6xl font-bold tracking-tight leading-[1.05]" style="font-family:'Space Grotesk',sans-serif;color:#1A1A1A;">
      Privacy & cookies
    </h1>
    <p class="mt-4 text-sm" style="font-family:'Satoshi',sans-serif;color:#6B7280;">
      Last updated: July 2026
    </p>

    <div class="mt-12 md:mt-16 space-y-10 legal-prose" style="font-family:'Satoshi',sans-serif;color:#374151;">

      <div>
        <h2>1. Data controller</h2>
        <p>
          The controller of personal data collected through this website is:
        </p>
        <ul>
          <li><strong>Identity:</strong> Unicornio Azul (Luis Chicharro)</li>
          <li><strong>Address:</strong> Madrid, Spain</li>
          <li><strong>Email:</strong> <a href="mailto:luis.chicharro@unicornioazul.es">luis.chicharro@unicornioazul.es</a></li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2>2. Data we collect</h2>
        <p>We may process the following categories of data:</p>
        <ul>
          <li><strong>Identification and contact data:</strong> name, surname, email, phone, company.</li>
          <li><strong>Project data:</strong> information you voluntarily provide when describing your idea or needs.</li>
          <li><strong>Browsing data:</strong> IP address, browser type, pages visited and similar technical data, where applicable.</li>
        </ul>
        <p>
          We do not request special categories of data (health, ideology, etc.). Please do not send us that type of information.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2>3. Purpose and legal basis</h2>
        <p>We process your data for the following purposes:</p>
        <ul>
          <li><strong>Managing enquiries and contact requests</strong> («Get started» form, email, etc.). Legal basis: steps prior to entering into a contract at your request and/or legitimate interest in responding (Art. 6(1)(b) and 6(1)(f) GDPR).</li>
          <li><strong>Maintaining the commercial relationship</strong> if we work together. Legal basis: performance of a contract (Art. 6(1)(b) GDPR).</li>
          <li><strong>Complying with applicable legal obligations.</strong> Legal basis: legal obligation (Art. 6(1)(c) GDPR).</li>
          <li><strong>Improving the Site and analysing its use</strong>, where applicable via cookies or measurement tools. Legal basis: consent or legitimate interest, depending on the cookie type (see cookies section).</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2>4. Retention</h2>
        <p>
          We will keep your data for as long as needed to handle your request and, where applicable, for the duration of the commercial relationship. Afterwards, data will be blocked for the legally required limitation periods and then securely deleted.
        </p>
        <p>
          Data from enquiries that do not become a commercial relationship will generally be kept for a maximum of 12 months from the last contact, unless you request earlier deletion.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2>5. Recipients and processors</h2>
        <p>
          We do not sell your data. Technical service providers (hosting, email, form tools) may access it as processors under Art. 28 GDPR, with appropriate safeguards.
        </p>
        <p>
          If international data transfers occur in the future, they will be carried out with the safeguards provided for in the GDPR (standard contractual clauses, adequacy decisions or other valid guarantees).
        </p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2>6. Your rights</h2>
        <p>You may exercise the following rights at any time:</p>
        <ul>
          <li>Access, rectification and erasure</li>
          <li>Restriction of processing</li>
          <li>Data portability</li>
          <li>Objection</li>
          <li>Withdrawal of consent, where processing is based on it</li>
        </ul>
        <p>
          To exercise them, write to <a href="mailto:luis.chicharro@unicornioazul.es">luis.chicharro@unicornioazul.es</a> stating the right you wish to exercise and, if needed, attaching documentation proving your identity.
        </p>
        <p>
          You may also lodge a complaint with the Spanish Data Protection Agency (<a href="https://www.aepd.es" target="_blank" rel="noopener">www.aepd.es</a>).
        </p>
      </div>

      <div id="cookies">
        <h2>7. Cookies</h2>
        <p>
          Cookies are small files stored on your device when you visit a website. They can remember preferences, keep the site secure or, with your consent, measure how the site is used so we can improve it.
        </p>

        <h3>7.1. Technical cookies (necessary)</h3>
        <p>
          Essential for the Site to work. This includes the local storage entry that saves your cookie consent preference. These do not require prior consent.
        </p>
        <ul>
          <li><strong>ua_cookie_consent</strong> — Stores your choice (accept all / necessary only). Duration: persistent in the browser until you clear it or change preferences.</li>
        </ul>

        <h3>7.2. Analytics cookies (optional)</h3>
        <p>
          Only activated if you choose «Accept all» on the banner. They help us understand Site use in aggregate (pages visited, traffic sources, etc.) and improve the experience.
        </p>
        <p>
          After you accept, we load <strong>Google Tag Manager</strong> (container <code>GTM-TJRCJ7T8</code>), which may fire measurement tags such as Google Analytics. They are not loaded until you give consent. Google may process data in the U.S. or other countries under GDPR-appropriate safeguards.
        </p>

        <h3>7.3. Legal basis</h3>
        <p>
          Technical cookies are based on the legitimate interest in providing the requested service (Art. 6(1)(f) GDPR) and the cookie-law exception. Analytics cookies are based on your consent (Art. 6(1)(a) GDPR), which you may withdraw at any time.
        </p>

        <h3>7.4. How to manage your consent</h3>
        <p>When you enter the Site you will see a banner where you can:</p>
        <ul>
          <li><strong>Accept all</strong> — Allows technical and analytics cookies.</li>
          <li><strong>Necessary only</strong> — Technical cookies only; no analytics.</li>
        </ul>
        <p>
          To change your decision later, clear this site’s data in your browser (local storage / cookies) and reload the page; the banner will appear again. You can also configure your browser to block or delete cookies.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2>8. Security</h2>
        <p>
          We apply reasonable technical and organisational measures to protect your data against unauthorised access, loss or alteration. No system is completely infallible; we recommend not sending sensitive information through unencrypted channels.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2>9. Minors</h2>
        <p>
          Unicornio Azul's services are aimed at professionals and businesses. We do not knowingly collect data from children under 14. If you become aware that a minor has provided us with data, contact us so we can delete it.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2>10. Changes</h2>
        <p>
          We may update this policy to reflect legal or process changes. The current version will be published on this page with the date of the last update.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2>11. Contact</h2>
        <p>
          For any privacy questions: <a href="mailto:luis.chicharro@unicornioazul.es">luis.chicharro@unicornioazul.es</a>.
        </p>
        <p>
          See also our <a href="/en/legal-notice">Legal notice</a>.
        </p>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<Footer lang="en" />

</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .legal-prose h2 {
    font-family: 'Space Grotesk', sans-serif;
    font-size: 1.25rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: #163667;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
  }
  .legal-prose h3 {
    font-family: 'Space Grotesk', sans-serif;
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: #1A1A1A;
    margin: 1rem 0 0.5rem;
  }
  .legal-prose p {
    font-size: 1rem;
    line-height: 1.7;
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
  }
  .legal-prose ul {
    list-style: disc;
    padding-left: 1.25rem;
    margin: 0.75rem 0 0.25rem;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.4rem;
  }
  .legal-prose li {
    font-size: 1rem;
    line-height: 1.65;
  }
  .legal-prose a {
    color: #163667;
    font-weight: 600;
    text-decoration: underline;
    text-underline-offset: 3px;
  }
  .legal-prose a:hover {
    opacity: 0.7;
  }
  .legal-prose strong {
    color: #1A1A1A;
    font-weight: 600;
  }
</style>
